### V106 — Prediction outcomes

```sql
CREATE TABLE prediction_outcomes (
    id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,

    prediction_id BIGINT NOT NULL
        REFERENCES prediction_snapshots(id),

    horizon_days INTEGER NOT NULL,

    outcome_status VARCHAR(30),

