Possible statuses:

- PENDING
- TARGET_HIT
- STOP_HIT
- HORIZON_EXPIRED
- BOTH_SAME_BAR
- DATA_UNAVAILABLE
- INVALID_SIGNAL

Use an explicit `first_hit` convention. If both target and stop occur on the same daily candle, classify the result as STOP_FIRST unless intraday evidence establishes the sequence.

